{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape your experience - Your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Trials Survivors</strong></i> is a roguelite that fuses the simplicity of survivor-style gameplay with the loot-driven depth of hack and slash RPGs. Each skill is hand-crafted and endlessly upgradeable, letting you forge unique builds as you face trials set by the constellations. Overcome the odds, embrace the loot, and ascend into an unkillable god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.poster.avif?t=1771542707\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.webm?t=1771542707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/49d1c9ba8967d99f82bb1dc25b316a05.mp4?t=1771542707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/78dfc05b6ef2062393d58792ef9e4b77.avif?t=1771542707\" alt=\"BULLET HEAVEN \u2013 DEFY THE ODDS\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of the stars, you must complete their Trials, survive impossible odds, and push back the encroaching darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple archetypes to define your starting loadout. Your main spell is aimed manually, while all other spells auto-target nearby enemies, letting you focus on movement, survival, and securing loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.poster.avif?t=1771542707\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.webm?t=1771542707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/992ad9a7208c4b9a91d1fd181686dec7.mp4?t=1771542707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/7cbdf7c2b8868b86aa38950e83893f4e.avif?t=1771542707\" alt=\"TRIALS AND POWERFUL SYNERGIES\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is divided into <strong>Trials</strong>,\u00a0cosmic challenges that test your skills, such as surviving for 5 minutes or defeating a set number of enemies before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing Trials rewards you with experience and upgrades. Collect new spells, enhance your powers, and build devastating synergies to unleash chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.poster.avif?t=1771542707\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.webm?t=1771542707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/0ec135d23ddc606ac0b6b096c0ddc95e.mp4?t=1771542707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/23d6885be447b130918ef16a1e8131ee.avif?t=1771542707\" alt=\"RELICS AND PROGRESSION\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Relics</strong>,\u00a0powerful, socketable items that grant <strong>permanent progression</strong> and unlock more\u00a0<strong>player power</strong> in every run\u2026 if you choose to equip them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Relic grants stats: from global additional projectiles, to increased pierce, extra chain count, bonus damage, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a stat exists on a spell, chances are there\u2019s a Relic that can supercharge it. The result?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absolute build freedom, and total disregard for visual clarity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/dfb6aed351c56ea3de0abf43b4c1e921.avif?t=1771542707\" width=1200 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/extras/bc061e62e7647fdd55d430efaa1bbe1e.avif?t=1771542707\" alt=\"PUSHING THE SURVIVOR-LIKE FANTASY\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love <strong>monster density</strong>. This game was built from the ground up to handle absurd numbers of enemies and projectiles on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our dream? To let you craft <strong>an overpowered build worthy of the greatest Hack&amp;Slash games, in under 30 minutes of survival gameplay</strong>. And we truly believe we can deliver on that promise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If that sounds like your kind of chaos, we\u2019d love to have you on board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS RELEASE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Constellations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >57 Spell evolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic Merchant (It's a cat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of loot</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762660?t=1771542707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/708f4cbd60b0676ba1caf83c7a81ed6cb266a608/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771542707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/43cfdb5d40fa0964908053955e34c51755d726d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771542707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762660/43cfdb5d40fa0964908053955e34c51755d726d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771542707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4092390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape your experience - Your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Trials Survivors</strong></i> is a roguelite that fuses the simplicity of survivor-style gameplay with the loot-driven depth of hack and slash RPGs. Each skill is hand-crafted and endlessly upgradeable, letting you forge unique builds as you face trials set by the constellations. Overcome the odds, embrace the loot, and ascend into an unkillable god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=